      "writtenOn": "2017-01-30T22:35:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we don\u0027t expecet a null IWificond at any time.\nI will add handling code in WifiStateMachine and rephrase the logging here.\nIn terms of distinguish the error, for now we only return a null to WifiStateMachine. This will be handled in WificondControl internally when WificondControl() takes the full control of IWificond.",
