      "writtenOn": "2017-01-30T22:35:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As a result of b/30159593, wificond doesn\u0027t return any error code. Even if wificond returns error code, that would trigger a RuntimeException instead of a RemoteException.\nWith that said, java side won\u0027t get any RemoteException triggered by wificond.\nIf it does happen, the only reason could be an internal error of binder object transaction.\nIn that case we don\u0027t have much to do here. I think binder itself will log the context.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 52,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 52,
        "endChar": 40
      },
